g us that the", "published_at": "2026-09-26T00:12:34Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-26T11:11:59Z", "body": "bodies/feed-a4df3a75cecd.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-a800ccfa1cea", "title": "Katakanization: The Secret Rules of Converting English into Japanese", "source": "Tofugu", "author": "", "url": "https://www.tofugu.com/japanese/katakanization/", "image_url": "https://files.tofugu.com/articles/japanese/2022-11-22-katakanization/header-1280x.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Learning", "topic": "japanese", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Learning", "Tofugu", "en", "japanese", "text", "日语学习"], "excerpt": "Japanese words that even the most proficient learners of the language find the hardest to pronounce can be, ironically, the ones borrowed from their own native", "published_at": "2026-09-26T11:10:23Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-26T11:11:59Z", "body": "bodies/feed-a800ccfa1cea.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-baf74db6e3f3", "title": "Solidigm冲刺美股史上最大半导体IPO！英特尔曾以90亿美元卖掉，如今估值或达1500亿美元", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782575", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/2de0ed5e-86e4-4772-ab87-6465cb075a66.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资"], "excerpt": "SK海力士旗下固态存储子公司Solidigm正筹划赴美上市，目标估值高达1500亿美元，拟募资150亿美元，有望刷新美股半导体IPO纪录。而这家公司的前身，正是英特尔以约88.5亿美元出售的NAND闪存业务——从被剥离的非核心资产，到如今估值翻逾十倍的AI存储明星，Solidigm的蜕变折射出这轮AI基础设施投资热潮对", "published_at": "2026-09-26T03:08:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-26T11:11:59Z", "body": "bodies/feed-baf74db6e3f3.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-d1f8692f1e2a", "title": "维密重回上海淮海路，中国市场进入扩店阶段｜最前线", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://3